 "attributes": {
  "title": {
   "en": "Teishitsu Kyuden No Minarai Nyokan Miai Kaihi De Koi Wo Shiru!?"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "帝室宮殿の見習い女官　見合い回避で恋を知る！？"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "In an era when women were expected to obey their husbands and households, becoming 'good wives and wise mothers' as the pinnacle of virtue...\n\nHinako, who returned from years abroad and graduated from a girls' school, faced pressure from her mother to accept a 'suitable' arranged marriage to a man thirty years her senior. Struggling with the gap between her own values and societal norms, she found hope in her great-aunt’s proposal: employment as a court lady in the imperial palace.\n\nAfter passing the rigorous exam and breaking free from her mother’s control, Hinako began her new life at the palace. But...?",
   "ja": "夫と家に従い、良き妻・賢き母となることが婦人の美徳とされた時代。\n長い異国暮らしから帰国、編入した女学校の卒業を迎えた妃奈子は、\n母が勧める”ふさわしい”お相手――三十も年上の中年男との縁談を迫られていた。\n自身の価値観と常識のギャップに苦しむ中、大叔母から提案された宮中女官への採用に\n彼女は希望を見いだす。\n晴れて採用試験を突破、母の呪縛からも解放されて宮殿勤めを始めた妃奈子だったが…？"
  },
